    { "id": "s248", "unit": "u25", "hanzi": "这一点我保留意见", "pinyin": "zhè yì diǎn wǒ bǎoliú yìjiàn", "en": "On that point I reserve judgement",
      "words": [{"h":"这一点","p":"zhè yì diǎn","e":"on this point"},{"h":"我","p":"wǒ","e":"I"},{"h":"保留意见","p":"bǎoliú yìjiàn","e":"reserve my opinion"}] },
    { "id": "s249", "unit": "u25", "hanzi": "那我们各自保留看法吧", "pinyin": "nà wǒmen gèzì bǎoliú kànfǎ ba", "en": "Then let's agree to disagree",
